Bug 2061218 - Handle failed calendar event edits and moves. r=#thunderbird-front-end-reviewers

Remove failed transactions from Undo history. Retain destination copies left by failed moves for cleanup on retry. Check each copy's content and saved revision before deletion, preserving changes made by another editor.

Add conditional deletion to the storage provider and tests for failed transactions.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332891


